eral>F<\/literal>Microseconds, numeric, at least 6 digits with leading 0<literal>007701<\/literal>, <literal>052738<\/literal>, <literal>428291<\/literal><literal>f<\/literal>Microseconds, numeric<literal>7701<\/literal>, <literal>52738<\/literal>, <literal>428291<\/literal><literal>R<\/literal>Sign \"<literal>-<\/literal>\" when negative, \"<literal>+<\/literal>\" when positive<literal>-<\/literal>, <literal>+<\/literal><literal>r<\/literal>Sign \"<literal>-<\/literal>\" when negative, empty when positive<literal>-<\/literal>, <literal\/>"]],["string","Returns the formatted interval."],["DateTime::diff"]]
