["function","Add value to field without carrying into more significant fields\n\nObject-oriented style\n\nProcedural style\n\nAdds a (signed) amount to a field. The difference with respect to <function>IntlCalendar::add<\/function> is that when the field value overflows, it does not carry into more significant fields.",[["$calendar","IntlCalendar","An <classname>IntlCalendar<\/classname> instance."],["$field","int","One of the <classname>IntlCalendar<\/classname> date\/time field constants. These are integer values between <literal>0<\/literal> and <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_COUNT<\/constant>."],["$value","int|bool","The (signed) amount to add to the field, <type>true<\/type> for rolling up (adding <literal>1<\/literal>), or <type>false<\/type> for rolling down (subtracting <literal>1<\/literal>)."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["IntlCalendar::add","IntlCalendar::set"]]
["function","Set a time field or several common fields at once\n\nObject-oriented style\n\nProcedural style\n\nSets either a specific field to the given value, or sets at once several common fields. The range of values that are accepted depend on whether the calendar is using the lenient mode.\n\nFor fields that conflict, the fields that are set later have priority.\n\nThis method cannot be called with exactly four arguments.",[["$cal","IntlCalendar","An <classname>IntlCalendar<\/classname> instance."],["$field","int","One of the <classname>IntlCalendar<\/classname> date\/time field constants. These are integer values between <literal>0<\/literal> and <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_COUNT<\/constant>."],["$value","int","The new value of the given field."],["$year","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_YEAR<\/constant>."],["$month","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_MONTH<\/constant>. The month sequence is zero-based, i.e., January is represented by 0, February by 1, â€¦, December is 11 and Undecember (if the calendar has it) is 12."],["$dayOfMonth","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_DAY_OF_MONTH<\/constant>."],["$hour","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_HOUR_OF_DAY<\/constant>."],["$minute","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_MINUTE<\/constant>."],["$second","int","The new value for <constant>IntlCalendar::FIELD_SECOND<\/constant>."]],["true","Always returns <type>true<\/type>."],["IntlCalendar::get","IntlCalendar::add","IntlCalendar::roll"]]
