["function","Efficiently move the engine ahead by 2^128 steps\n\nMoves the algorithmâ€™s state ahead by 2128 steps, as if <function>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar::generate<\/function> was called 2128 times.\n\nThe purpose of a jump is to facilitate the creation of a new <classname>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar<\/classname> engine from an existing seeded <classname>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar<\/classname> engine. The seeded engine acts as a blueprint, which can be cloned and repeatedly jumped to create 2128 non-overlapping sequences with 2128 values each.",null,["void","No value is returned."],["<function>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar::jumpLong<\/function>"]]
["function","Efficiently move the engine ahead by 2^192 steps\n\nMoves the algorithmâ€™s state ahead by 2192 steps, as if <function>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar::generate<\/function> was called 2192 times.\n\nThe purpose of a long jump is to facilitate the creation of a new <classname>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar<\/classname> engine from an existing seeded <classname>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar<\/classname> engine. The seeded engine acts as a blueprint, which can be cloned and repeatedly jumped to create 264 non-overlapping sequences with 2192 values each.\n\nLong jumping may be combined with <function>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar::jump<\/function>ing to further split each of the 264 sequences generated by long jumping, into 264 sequences of 2128 values each.",null,["void","No value is returned."],["<function>Random\\Engine\\Xoshiro256StarStar::jump<\/function>"]]
