["function","Update timestamp\n\nUpdates the last modification timestamp of the session. This function is automatically executed when a session is updated.",[["$id","string","The session ID."],["$data","string","The session data."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> if the timestamp was updated, <type>false<\/type> otherwise. Note that this value is returned internally to PHP for processing."]]
