["function","Tell the cursor position of the LOB object\n\nThe <function>cubrid_lob2_tell64<\/function> function is used to tell the cursor position of the LOB object. If the size of a lob object is larger than an integer data can be stored, you can use this function and it will return the position information as a string.",[["$lob_identifier","resource","Lob identifier as a result of <function>cubrid_lob2_new<\/function> or get from the result set."]],["string","It will return the cursor position on the LOB object as a string when it processes successfully, or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>cubrid_lob2_read<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_write<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_seek<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_seek64<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_tell<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_size<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_size64<\/function>"]]
["function","Write to a lob object\n\nThe <function>cubrid_lob2_write<\/function> function reads as much as data from <parameter>buf<\/parameter> and stores it to the LOB object. Note that this function can only append characters now.",[["$lob_identifier","resource","Lob identifier as a result of <function>cubrid_lob2_new<\/function> or get from the result set."],["$buf","string","Data that need to be written to the lob object."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>cubrid_lob2_read<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_seek<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_seek64<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_tell<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_tell64<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_size<\/function>","<function>cubrid_lob2_size64<\/function>"]]
