["function","Return the number of columns in the result set\n\nThe <function>cubrid_num_cols<\/function> function is used to get the number of columns from the query result. It can only be used when the query executed is a <literal>SELECT<\/literal> statement.",[["$result","resource","Result."]],["int","Number of columns, when process is successful.\n\n<type>false<\/type>, if SQL statement is not SELECT."],["<function>cubrid_execute<\/function>","<function>cubrid_num_rows<\/function>"]]
