["function","Set autocommit mode of the connection\n\nThe <function>cubrid_set_autocommit<\/function> function is used to set the CUBRID database auto-commit mode of the current database connection.\n\nIn CUBRID PHP, auto-commit mode is disabled by default for transaction management. When auto-commit mode is truned from off to on, any pending work is automatically committed.",[["$conn_identifier","resource","Connection identifier."],["$mode","bool","Auto-commit mode. The following constants can be used:"]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>cubrid_get_autocommit<\/function>","<function>cubrid_commit<\/function>"]]
["function","Sets the CUBRID database parameters\n\nThe <function>cubrid_set_db_parameter<\/function> function is used to set the CUBRID database parameters. It can set the following CUBRID database parameters:\n\nThe auto-commit mode can be set by using <function>cubrid_set_autocommit<\/function>.",[["$conn_identifier","resource","The CUBRID connection. If the connection identifier is not specified, the last link opened by <function>cubrid_connect<\/function> is assumed."],["$param_type","int","Database parameter type."],["$param_value","int","Isolation level value (1-6) or lock timeout (in seconds) value."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>cubrid_get_db_parameter<\/function>","<function>cubrid_set_autocommit<\/function>"]]
