["function","Gets the default timezone used by all date\/time functions in a script\n\nIn order of preference, this function returns the default timezone by:  Reading the timezone set using the <function>date_default_timezone_set<\/function> function (if any)  Reading the value of the date.timezone ini option (if set) \n\nReading the timezone set using the <function>date_default_timezone_set<\/function> function (if any)\n\nReading the value of the date.timezone ini option (if set)\n\nIf none of the above succeed, date_default_timezone_get will return a default timezone of <literal>UTC<\/literal>.",null,["string","Returns a <type>string<\/type>."],["<function>date_default_timezone_set<\/function>",""]]
["function","Sets the default timezone used by all date\/time functions in a script\n\n<function>date_default_timezone_set<\/function> sets the default timezone used by all date\/time functions.\n\nInstead of using this function to set the default timezone in your script, you can also use the INI setting date.timezone to set the default timezone.",[["$timezoneId","string","The timezone identifier, like <literal>UTC<\/literal>, <literal>Africa\/Lagos<\/literal>, <literal>Asia\/Hong_Kong<\/literal>, or <literal>Europe\/Lisbon<\/literal>. The list of valid identifiers is available in the ."]],["bool","This function returns <type>false<\/type> if the <parameter>timezoneId<\/parameter> isn't valid, or <type>true<\/type> otherwise."],["<function>date_default_timezone_get<\/function>",""]]
