ences. Specify the library list elements separated by blanks 'i5_libl'=>\"MYLIB YOURLIB ANYLIB\".\n\n<parameter>i5_libl<\/parameter> calls qsys2\/qcmdexc('cmd',cmdlen), which is only available in i5\/OS V5R4 and later."]],["resource|false","Returns a connection handle resource if the connection attempt is successful. If the connection attempt fails, <function>db2_connect<\/function> returns <type>false<\/type>."],["<function>db2_close<\/function>","<function>db2_pconnect<\/function>"]]
