["function","Fetch data specified by key\n\nOverloaded signature deprecated as of 8.3.0:\n\n<function>dba_fetch<\/function> fetches the data specified by <parameter>key<\/parameter> from the database specified with <parameter>dba<\/parameter>.",[["$key","string|array","The key the data is specified by.\n\nWhen working with inifiles this function accepts arrays as keys where index 0 is the group and index 1 is the value name. See: <function>dba_key_split<\/function>."],["$dba","Dba\\Connection","A <classname>Dba\\Connection<\/classname> instance, returned by <function>dba_open<\/function> or <function>dba_popen<\/function>."],["$skip","int","The number of key-value pairs to ignore when using cdb databases. This value is ignored for all other databases which do not support multiple keys with the same name."]],["string|false","Returns the associated string if the key\/data pair is found, <type>false<\/type> otherwise."],["<function>dba_exists<\/function>","<function>dba_delete<\/function>","<function>dba_insert<\/function>","<function>dba_replace<\/function>","<function>dba_key_split<\/function>"]]
