["function","Adds a record to a database\n\nAdds the given data to the database.",[["$database","resource","The database resource, returned by <function>dbase_open<\/function> or <function>dbase_create<\/function>."],["$data","array","An indexed array of data. The number of items must be equal to the number of  fields in the database, otherwise <function>dbase_add_record<\/function> will fail.\n\nIf you're using <function>dbase_get_record<\/function> return value for this parameter, remember to reset the key named <literal>deleted<\/literal>."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>dbase_delete_record<\/function>","<function>dbase_replace_record<\/function>"]]
