["function","Returns the activation function\n\nGet the activation function for neuron number <literal>neuron<\/literal> in layer number <literal>layer<\/literal>, counting the input layer as layer 0.\n\nIt is not possible to get activation functions for the neurons in the input layer.\n\nThe return value is one of the activation functions constants.",[["$ann","resource","Neural network <type>resource<\/type>."],["$layer","int","Layer number."],["$neuron","int","Neuron number."]],["int","Learning functions constant or -1 if the neuron is not defined in the neural network, or <type>false<\/type> on error."],["<function>fann_set_activation_function_layer<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_function_hidden<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_function_output<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_steepness<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_function<\/function>"]]
["function","Returns the activation steepness for supplied neuron and layer number\n\nGet the activation steepness for neuron number <literal>neuron<\/literal> in layer number <literal>layer<\/literal>, counting the input layer as layer 0.\n\nIt is not possible to get activation steepness for the neurons in the input layer.\n\nThe steepness of an activation function says something about how fast the activation function goes from the minimum to the maximum.  A high value for the activation function will also give a more aggressive training.\n\nWhen training neural networks where the output values should be at the extremes (usually 0 and 1, depending on the activation function), a steep activation function can be used (e.g.  1.0).\n\nThe default activation steepness is 0.5.",[["$ann","resource","Neural network <type>resource<\/type>."],["$layer","int","Layer number"],["$neuron","int","Neuron number"]],["float","The activation steepness for the neuron or -1 if the neuron is not defined in the neural network, or <type>false<\/type> on error."],["<function>fann_set_activation_function<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_steepness_layer<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_steepness_hidden<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_steepness_output<\/function>","<function>fann_set_activation_steepness<\/function>"]]
