["function","Retrieves various runtime behaviours of the current FTP connection\n\nThis function returns the value for the requested  <parameter>option<\/parameter> from the specified FTP connection.",[["$ftp","FTP\\Connection","An <classname>FTP\\Connection<\/classname> instance."],["$option","int","Currently, the following options are supported: Supported runtime FTP options<constant>FTP_TIMEOUT_SEC<\/constant> Returns the current timeout used for network related operations. <constant>FTP_AUTOSEEK<\/constant> Returns <type>true<\/type> if this option is on, <type>false<\/type> otherwise.  "]],["int|bool","Returns the value on success or <type>false<\/type> if the given  <parameter>option<\/parameter> is not supported. In the latter case, a warning message is also thrown."],["<function>ftp_set_option<\/function>"]]
