["function","Retrieves a file from the FTP server and writes it to an open file (non-blocking)\n\n<function>ftp_nb_fget<\/function> retrieves a remote file from the FTP  server.\n\nThe difference between this function and <function>ftp_fget<\/function> is  that this function retrieves the file asynchronously, so your program can  perform other operations while the file is being downloaded.",[["$ftp","FTP\\Connection","An <classname>FTP\\Connection<\/classname> instance."],["$stream","resource","An open file pointer in which we store the data."],["$remote_filename","string","The remote file path."],["$mode","int","The transfer mode. Must be either <constant>FTP_ASCII<\/constant> or <constant>FTP_BINARY<\/constant>."],["$offset","int","The position in the remote file to start downloading from."]],["int","Returns <constant>FTP_FAILED<\/constant> or <constant>FTP_FINISHED<\/constant> or <constant>FTP_MOREDATA<\/constant>."],["<function>ftp_nb_get<\/function>","<function>ftp_nb_continue<\/function>","<function>ftp_fget<\/function>","<function>ftp_get<\/function>"]]
