["function","Truncates a file to a given length\n\nTakes the filepointer, <parameter>stream<\/parameter>, and truncates the file to length, <parameter>size<\/parameter>.",[["$stream","resource","The file pointer.\n\nThe <parameter>stream<\/parameter> must be open for writing."],["$size","int","The size to truncate to.\n\nIf <parameter>size<\/parameter> is larger than the file then the file is extended with null bytes.\n\nIf <parameter>size<\/parameter> is smaller than the file then the file is truncated to that size."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>fopen<\/function>","<function>fseek<\/function>"]]
