["function","Returns an array comprising a function's argument list\n\nGets an array of the function's argument list.\n\nThis function may be used in conjunction with  <function>func_get_arg<\/function> and <function>func_num_args<\/function> to allow user-defined functions to accept variable-length argument lists.",null,["array","Returns an array in which each element is a copy of the corresponding member of the current user-defined function's argument list."],["<literal>...<\/literal> syntax","<function>func_get_arg<\/function>","<function>func_num_args<\/function>","ReflectionFunctionAbstract::getParameters"]]
["function","Returns the number of arguments passed to the function\n\nGets the number of arguments passed to the function.\n\nThis function may be used in conjunction with  <function>func_get_arg<\/function> and <function>func_get_args<\/function> to allow user-defined functions to accept variable-length argument lists.",null,["int","Returns the number of arguments passed into the current user-defined function."],["<literal>...<\/literal> syntax","<function>func_get_arg<\/function>","<function>func_get_args<\/function>","ReflectionFunctionAbstract::getNumberOfParameters"]]
["function","Return true if the given function has been defined\n\nChecks the list of defined functions, both built-in (internal) and user-defined, for <parameter>function<\/parameter>.",[["$function","string","The function name, as a string."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> if <parameter>function<\/parameter> exists and is a function, <type>false<\/type> otherwise.\n\nThis function will return <type>false<\/type> for constructs, such as  <function>include_once<\/function> and <function>echo<\/function>."],["<function>method_exists<\/function>","<function>is_callable<\/function>","<function>get_defined_functions<\/function>","<function>class_exists<\/function>","<function>extension_loaded<\/function>"]]
["function","Binary-safe file write\n\n<function>fwrite<\/function> writes the contents of <parameter>data<\/parameter> to the file stream pointed to by <parameter>stream<\/parameter>.",[["$stream","resource","A file system pointer <type>resource<\/type>\nthat is typically created using <function>fopen<\/function>."],["$data","string","The string that is to be written."],["$length","int|null","If <parameter>length<\/parameter> is an <type>int<\/type>, writing will stop after <parameter>length<\/parameter> bytes have been written or the end of <parameter>data<\/parameter> is reached, whichever comes first."]],["int|false","<function>fwrite<\/function> returns the number of bytes written,  or <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>fread<\/function>","<function>fopen<\/function>","<function>fsockopen<\/function>","<function>popen<\/function>","<function>file_get_contents<\/function>","<function>pack<\/function>"]]
