["function","Append a string message to a specified mailbox\n\nAppends a string <parameter>message<\/parameter> to the specified <parameter>folder<\/parameter>.",[["$imap","IMAP\\Connection","An <classname>IMAP\\Connection<\/classname> instance."],["$folder","string","The mailbox name, see <function>imap_open<\/function> for more information\n\nPassing untrusted data to this parameter is insecure, unless\nimap.enable_insecure_rsh is disabled."],["$message","string","The message to be append, as a string\n\nWhen talking to the Cyrus IMAP server, you must use \"\\r\\n\" as your end-of-line terminator instead of \"\\n\" or the operation will fail"],["$options","string|null","If provided, the <parameter>options<\/parameter> will also be written to the <parameter>folder<\/parameter>"],["$internal_date","string|null","If this parameter is set, it will set the INTERNALDATE on the appended message.  The parameter should be a date string that conforms to the rfc2060 specifications for a date_time value."]],["bool","Returns <type>true<\/type> on success or <type>false<\/type> on failure."]]
