["function","Mark a message for deletion from current mailbox\n\nMarks messages listed in <parameter>message_nums<\/parameter> for deletion. Messages marked for deletion will stay in the mailbox until either <function>imap_expunge<\/function> is called or <function>imap_close<\/function> is called with the optional parameter <constant>CL_EXPUNGE<\/constant>.",[["$imap","IMAP\\Connection","An <classname>IMAP\\Connection<\/classname> instance."],["$message_nums","string","A <type>string<\/type> representing one or more messages in IMAP4-style sequence format (<literal>\"n\"<\/literal>, <literal>\"n:m\"<\/literal>, or combination of these delimited by commas)."],["$flags","int","You can set the <constant>FT_UID<\/constant> which tells the function to treat the <parameter>message_nums<\/parameter> argument as a <literal>UID<\/literal>."]],["true","Always returns <type>true<\/type>."],["<function>imap_undelete<\/function>","<function>imap_expunge<\/function>","<function>imap_close<\/function>"]]
