["function","Returns all of the IMAP errors that have occurred\n\nGets all of the IMAP errors (if any) that have occurred during this page request or since the error stack was reset.\n\nWhen <function>imap_errors<\/function> is called, the error stack is subsequently cleared.",null,["array|false","This function returns an array of all of the IMAP error messages generated since the last <function>imap_errors<\/function> call, or the beginning of the page. Returns <type>false<\/type> if no error messages are available."],["<function>imap_last_error<\/function>","<function>imap_alerts<\/function>"]]
