["function","Splits DN into its component parts\n\nSplits the DN returned by <function>ldap_get_dn<\/function> and breaks it up into its component parts. Each part is known as Relative Distinguished Name, or RDN.",[["$dn","string","The distinguished name of an LDAP entity."],["$with_attrib","int","Used to request if the RDNs are returned with only values or their attributes as well.  To get RDNs with the attributes (i.e. in attribute=value format) set <parameter>with_attrib<\/parameter> to 0 and to get only values set it to 1."]],["array|false","Returns an array of all DN components,  or <type>false<\/type> on failure. The first element in the array has <literal>count<\/literal> key and represents the number of returned values, next elements are numerically indexed DN components."]]
