["function","Get all result entries\n\nReads multiple entries from the given result, and then reading the attributes and multiple values.",[["$ldap","LDAP\\Connection","An <classname>LDAP\\Connection<\/classname> instance, returned by <function>ldap_connect<\/function>."],["$result","LDAP\\Result","An <classname>LDAP\\Result<\/classname> instance, returned by <function>ldap_list<\/function> or <function>ldap_search<\/function>."]],["array|false","Returns a complete result information in a multi-dimensional array on success, or <type>false<\/type> on failure.\n\nThe structure of the array is as follows. The attribute index is converted to lowercase. (Attributes are case-insensitive for directory servers, but not when used as array indices.) "],["<function>ldap_first_entry<\/function>","<function>ldap_next_entry<\/function>"]]
["function","Get the current value for given option\n\nSets <parameter>value<\/parameter> to the value of the specified option.",[["$ldap","LDAP\\Connection|null","Either an <classname>LDAP\\Connection<\/classname> instance, returned by <function>ldap_connect<\/function>, to get the option for that connection, or <type>null<\/type> to get the global option."],["$option","int","The parameter <parameter>option<\/parameter> can be one of: OptionTypesince<constant>LDAP_OPT_DEREF<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_SIZELIMIT<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_TIMELIMIT<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_NETWORK_TIMEOUT<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_PROTOCOL_VERSION<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_ERROR_NUMBER<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_DIAGNOSTIC_MESSAGE<\/constant><type>string<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_REFERRALS<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_RESTART<\/constant><type>int<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_HOST_NAME<\/constant><type>string<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_ERROR_STRING<\/constant><type>string<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_MATCHED_DN<\/constant><type>string<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_SERVER_CONTROLS<\/constant><type>array<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_CLIENT_CONTROLS<\/constant><type>array<\/type><constant>LDAP_OPT_X_KEEPALIVE_IDLE<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_KEEPALIVE_PROBES<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CACERTDIR<\/constant><type>string<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CACERTFILE<\/constant><type>string<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CERTFILE<\/constant><type>string<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CIPHER_SUITE<\/constant><type>string<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CRLCHECK<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CRL_NONE<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_OPT_X_TLS_CRL_PEER<\/constant><type>int<\/type>7.1<constant>LDAP_