["function","Return info about a group by group id\n\nGets information about a group provided its id.",[["$group_id","int","The group id."]],["array|false","The array elements returned are: The group information arrayElementDescriptionname The name element contains the name of the group. This is a short, usually less than 16 character \"handle\" of the group, not the real, full name. passwd The passwd element contains the group's password in an encrypted format. Often, for example on a system employing \"shadow\" passwords, an asterisk is returned instead. gid Group ID, should be the same as the <parameter>group_id<\/parameter> parameter used when calling the function, and hence redundant. members This consists of an <type>array<\/type> of <type>string<\/type>'s for all the members in the group.  The function returns <type>false<\/type> on failure."],["<function>posix_getegid<\/function>","<function>posix_getgrnam<\/function>","<function>filegroup<\/function>","<function>stat<\/function>","POSIX man page GETGRNAM(3)"]]
["function","Return info about a group by name\n\nGets information about a group provided its name.",[["$name","string","The name of the group"]],["array|false","Returns an <type>array<\/type> on success,  or <type>false<\/type> on failure. The array elements returned are: The group information arrayElementDescriptionname The name element contains the name of the group. This is a short, usually less than 16 character \"handle\" of the group, not the real, full name.  This should be the same as the <parameter>name<\/parameter> parameter used when calling the function, and hence redundant. passwd The passwd element contains the group's password in an encrypted format. Often, for example on a system employing \"shadow\" passwords, an asterisk is returned instead. gid Group ID of the group in numeric form. members This consists of an <type>array<\/type> of <type>string<\/type>'s for all the members in the group. "],["<function>posix_getegid<\/function>","<function>posix_getgrgid<\/function>","<function>filegroup<\/function>","<function>stat<\/function>","POSIX man page GETGRNAM(3)"]]
